# Corner radii

Never ship a square corner on wawona.io. No `border-radius: 0` on visible
chrome. No 1-4px radii on boxes, buttons, cards, inputs, banners, or labels.
Those read as squares.

Keep the existing look:

- cards / banners: 12-26px
- buttons / controls: 10-12px
- pills: 100px / 999px
- circles: 50%

Nested shells that share an edge must stay concentric: parent radius equals
child radius plus the padding between them. Give the curve enough padding so
text and controls do not hit the corner. Do not flatten the child to satisfy
a formula. Do not rewrite the whole site to tokens or
`calc(var(--r-inset) + var(--pad))`.

Pills and circles stay pills and circles.

Exempt: 1-2px hairline tracks, shimmer underlines, donation slider FX
particles, and the slider knob morph.
